TIP:  Tom will play the next chord in the sequence a half-second or so before singing the lyric.  You'll notice this immediately.  

TIP:  For the (Asus4) (A) you'll already be at (A) so just add your pinky to the 2nd string/3rd fret (on/off) or slide your bottom finger up one fret (up/back).  Between verses it's played twice and ends on the (Asus4); between verse and chorus just once ending with an (A).
  
        
